<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW TO PAY NO DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW TO PAY NO DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish meat producer Sokolow SA will vote on April 19 on management's proposal to pay no dividend for 1996, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sokolow said 7.5 million zlotys of its 7.9-million-zloty net profit last year would be put into reserves and the rest would go toward the summer vacations of employees' children.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
